  {
   "type": "done",
   "answer": "不是。根据当前课件，超线程（Hyper-Threading）并不等于增加一个完全独立的物理核，而是引入**同时多线程（SMT, Simultaneous Multithreading）**技术。\n\n具体解释如下：\n*   **共享物理核心**：多个硬件线程（hardware threads）共享**一个**物理核心（one physical core）[S1]。\n*   **独立与共享的资源**：每个逻辑线程拥有自己独立的架构状态（architectural state），但执行单元（execution units）、缓存（caches）、队列（queues）和预测器（predictors）是**共享**的 [S1]。\n\n因此，超线程是在同一个物理核上通过共享部分硬件资源来同时处理多个线程，而不是提供两个完全独立的物理核。\n\n**PDF物理页码**：第 29 页 [S1]。",
   "citations": [
    {
     "document_id": "34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402",
     "chunk_id": "34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402-p29-1",
     "page": 29,
     "text": "CPU: Optimize Latency of a Small Number of Complex Threads\n  Optimization #6: OoO Superscalar with Hyper-Threading\n\n¡  Problem: Even OoO superscalar cores have idle slot issues.\n\n¡  Reasons:\n\n   ¡  Cache miss, branch misprediction, dependency chain……\n\n\n¡  Hyper-threading introduces simultaneous multithreading (SMT)\n\n   ¡  Multiple hardware threads share one physical core.\n\n   ¡  Each logical thread has its own architectural state.\n\n   ¡  Execution units, caches, queues, and predictors are shared.\n\n\n\n¡ The closest architecture to modern CPUs.",
     "preview_url": "/api/documents/34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402/pages/29/preview",
     "source": "S1"
    }
